  },
  "content": {
   "raw": "<p>Hexis is one company brain for your team and all its AI agents. Through Hexis, your team can align on shared context that&#039;s important to align on, non-technical teams can work and collaborate on skills and your team can have hundreds of tools accessible via one MCP gateway. All the information is owned by someone, meaning it&#039;s context you can trust, and Hexis enables access control to a single file. It only takes a few minutes to set up, and is free for up to 3 people. Would love your feedback!</p>\n",
